    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Talbot is delighted to present 27 Farnamurray Close to the market, a superb four-bedroom semi-detached residence presented in excellent condition throughout. Finished to an exceptional standard, this attractive family home offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation extending to approximately 115 sq.m. and is ideally located in a sought-after residential development close to all local amenities.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an inviting entrance hallway, a bright and spacious living room featuring an inset solid fuel stove, elegant coving, and a bay window that floods the room with natural light. The generously sized kitchen/dining area provides an excellent space for family living and entertaining, with sliding doors opening onto a private rear garden. A guest WC and utility room complete the ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, there are four well-appointed bedrooms, all benefiting from built-in wardrobes. The master bedroom enjoys the added convenience of an ensuite, while a modern family shower room serves the remaining bedrooms.\n\nThe property enjoys an excellent location, situated just 700 metres from Nenagh Hospital, approximately 1 kilometre from Nenagh town centre, 3 kilometres from the M7 motorway, and only 40 kilometres from Castletroy, making it an ideal choice for commuters and families alike.\n\nThis outstanding home combines quality finishes, generous living space, and a highly convenient location, offering a turnkey opportunity for prospective purchasers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.89m x 0.63m\nporcelain tiled floor, coving, radiator cover and stairs leading to the first floor.\n\nLiving Room - 6.18m x 4.06m\nwalnut effect laminate flooring, large bay window, coving and inset stove with timber surround\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.57m x 4.39m\nfully fitted kitchen units, porcelain tiled floor, integrated fridge/freezer, dishwasher, electric oven and induction hob, sliding doors to rear garden and coving\n\nW.C. - 2.28m x 1.39m\nporcelain tiled floor, wc and handbasin\n\nUtility Room - 2.22m x 1.39m\nporcelain tiled floor, fitted units and plumbing for washing machine\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.02m x 2.79m\ntimber flooring and built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.78m x 2.96m\ntimber flooring and built in wardrobe\n\nShower Room - 2.18m x 1.51m\nfully tiled, wc, handbasin, double shower tray, power shower and heated towel rail\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.89m x 2.52m\ntimber flooring and built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 4 (Master) - 5.21m x 3.44m\ntimber flooring, built in wardrobes, large bay window\n\nEnsuite - 1.67m x 1.52m\nfully tiled, wc, handbasin, electric shower and heated towel rail\n\n"
      },
